 "summary": "The Spyglass SG50-F is a family of optical flame detectors (multi-IR, UV/IR and hydrogen-flame types, some with HD video). Its RS-485 port speaks Modbus RTU: input registers carry alarm, fault, built-in-test flags and the detector type, and holding registers set sensitivity, delays, latching, heater, video and the clock. This map covers every register the manual defines except the 32-bit and IP fields.",
